By intentionally submitting a contribution to this repository, unless a separate written agreement applies, the contributor grants the project maintainer a perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free, irrevocable license to use, reproduce, modify, distribute, publicly display, publicly perform, sublicense, and commercialize that contribution as part of Kadocacio and related project distributions.

Contributions made to MIT-covered components are additionally offered under the MIT License so that those components can remain MIT-licensed.

No copyright ownership is transferred merely by contributing.

